@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .

<https://www.glossarist.org/dpp/dataset/dpp/concept/dpp-0132>
  a skos:Concept ;
  skos:notation "dpp-0132" ;
  skos:prefLabel "passive twin"@eng ;
  skos:definition "digital twin reconstructed from point-in-time attestations about the object, sampled when the object visits an attestor, in which truth is episodic and staleness between attestations is unbounded and undetectable"@eng ;
  skos:scopeNote "Corresponds to capability classes S0 (silent, testimony-only) and S1 (passive authentication)."@eng ;
  skos:scopeNote "Trust rides entirely on attestor authority; the twin is testimonial by default and sensorial by exception."@eng
 .